# Copy this file to `.env` and fill in your own free-tier API key(s)
# for whichever LLM API you use in agents.py.
# .env is already excluded via .gitignore — never commit real keys.

# Example (uncomment whichever you use):
# OPENAI_API_KEY=your_key_here
# GOOGLE_API_KEY=your_key_here
# GROQ_API_KEY=your_key_here
